{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0026-remove-duplicates","title":"LeetCode 26 删除有序数组中的重复项","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0026-remove-duplicates","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-26-删除有序数组中的重复项\">LeetCode 26 删除有序数组中的重复项</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个非递减顺序排列的整数数组 <code>nums</code>，请你原地删除重复出现的元素，使每个元素只出现一次，返回删除后数组的新长度。元素的相对顺序应该保持一致，然后返回 <code>nums</code> 中唯一元素的个数。</p>\n<p>考虑 <code>nums</code> 的唯一元素的数量为 <code>k</code>，你需要做以下事情确保你的题解可以被通过：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更改数组 <code>nums</code>，使 <code>nums</code> 的前 <code>k</code> 个元素包含唯一元素，并按照它们最初在 <code>nums</code> 中出现的顺序排列</li>\n<li>返回 <code>k</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 3 × 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>nums</code> 已按非递减顺序排列</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,1,2]&#10;输出：2, nums = [1,2,_]&#10;解释：函数应该返回新的长度 2，并且原数组 nums 的前两个元素被修改为 1, 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,1,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：2, nums = [1,2,_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：函数应该返回新的长度 2，并且原数组 nums 的前两个元素被修改为 1, 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]&#10;输出：5, nums = [0,1,2,3,4,_,_,_,_,_]&#10;解释：函数应该返回新的长度 5，并且原数组 nums 的前五个元素被修改为 0, 1, 2, 3, 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：5, nums = [0,1,2,3,4,_,_,_,_,_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：函数应该返回新的长度 5，并且原数组 nums 的前五个元素被修改为 0, 1, 2, 3, 4</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的关键约束是<strong>原地操作</strong>，即不能分配额外数组，只能在原数组上修改。由于数组已经排好序，所有重复元素一定是相邻的，这为我们使用双指针技巧提供了基础。</p>\n<p><strong>快慢指针法</strong>是解决此类&quot;原地去重&quot;问题的经典方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>慢指针 <code>slow</code></strong>：指向当前已去重序列的末尾位置，代表&quot;结果数组&quot;的写入位置</li>\n<li><strong>快指针 <code>fast</code></strong>：遍历整个数组，负责扫描每一个元素</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算法逻辑非常清晰：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始化 <code>slow = 0</code>，<code>fast = 1</code></li>\n<li>当 <code>nums[fast] !== nums[slow]</code> 时，说明遇到了新的不同元素</li>\n<li>将 <code>slow</code> 前进一步，然后把 <code>nums[fast]</code> 的值复制到 <code>nums[slow]</code></li>\n<li><code>fast</code> 持续前进，直到遍历完整个数组</li>\n<li>最终 <code>slow + 1</code> 即为去重后的数组长度</li>\n</ol>\n<p>为什么这个方法正确？因为数组有序，相同元素必然连续出现。当 <code>fast</code> 指针发现一个与 <code>slow</code> 位置不同的值时，这个值一定是下一个唯一元素。通过将它放到 <code>slow + 1</code> 的位置，我们就在原地构建了一个无重复的子数组。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>是否原地</th>\n<th>适用前提</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力（新建数组）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>任意数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快慢双指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>数组已排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set 去重</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>任意数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function removeDuplicates(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  if (nums.length === 0) return 0;&#10;&#10;  let slow = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let fast = 1; fast &lt; nums.length; fast++) {&#10;    if (nums[fast] !== nums[slow]) {&#10;      slow++;&#10;      nums[slow] = nums[fast];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return slow + 1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> removeDuplicates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; fast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[fast] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[slow]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nums[slow] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[fast];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>该实现简洁且高效。<code>slow</code> 始终指向最后一个被确认的唯一元素位置，<code>fast</code> 负责向前探索。每当发现新元素，就将其&quot;收编&quot;到已确认序列的末尾。</p>\n<p>进阶版本——<strong>允许每个元素最多出现两次</strong>（LeetCode 80）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function removeDuplicatesII(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  if (nums.length &lt;= 2) return nums.length;&#10;&#10;  let slow = 2;&#10;&#10;  for (let fast = 2; fast &lt; nums.length; fast++) {&#10;    if (nums[fast] !== nums[slow - 2]) {&#10;      nums[slow] = nums[fast];&#10;      slow++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return slow;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> removeDuplicatesII</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; fast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[fast] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nums[slow] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[fast];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>快指针遍历整个数组一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用两个指针变量，无额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赋值操作次数</td>\n<td>最多 k-1 次</td>\n<td>k 为不同元素个数，首个元素无需赋值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>快慢指针是处理有序数组原地操作的核心模式。当你看到&quot;原地修改&quot;和&quot;有序数组&quot;两个条件同时出现时，应该立刻想到这个技巧。本题与 LC #27（移除元素）、LC #80（删除有序数组中的重复项 II）构成一组经典的双指针原地操作系列。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 26 删除有序数组中的重复项","id":"leetcode-26-删除有序数组中的重复项"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 1 两数之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0001-two-sum"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 27 移除元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0027-remove-element"}}